OL,3,GNEWSADriving an hour in labour would be
OL,4,Aterrifying, say mums
OL,5,
OL,6,FTravelling for an hour by car while in
OL,7,Flabour to reach a maternity unit if
OL,8,Fdelivery services at a nearby hospital
OL,9,Fwere closed would be "terrifying" and a
OL,10,F"matter of life and death", mothers
OL,11,Fhave said.
OL,13,FThe Norfolk and Waveney University
OL,14,FHospitals Group ((NWUHG), which runs
OL,15,FJames Paget University Hospital in
OL,16,FGorleston-on-Sea and the Queen
OL,17,FElizabeth Hospital is King's Lynn, said
OL,18,Fit was considering the future of the
OL,19,Fdelivery suites at both sites and
OL,20,Fpossibly moving all births to Norfolk
OL,21,Fand Norwich University Hospital.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
