OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADriving an hour in labour would be
OL,4,Aterrifying, say mums
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said both hospitals delivered fewer
OL,7,Fthan 2,000 births a year, which meant
OL,8,Fsome trainee midwives were not able to
OL,9,Fgain the experience required for
OL,10,Fassessment.
OL,12,F"If I'd had to go all the way to the
OL,13,FNorfolk and Norwich, potentially I
OL,14,Fwould have given birth in the car, we
OL,15,Fmight not have got there," said
OL,16,Fmother-of-three Gemma Kerridge, 40, who
OL,17,Flives in Lowestoft, Suffolk.
